---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="OwnerOS – Run your business from one workspace"
  description="Stop checking email, your calendar, accounting software, and your CRM just to figure out what needs your attention. OwnerOS brings everything together into one morning brief."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="pill">For owner-led firms</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Run your business from one workspace.</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">Stop checking email, your calendar, accounting software, and your CRM just to figure out what needs your attention.<br><br>OwnerOS brings everything together into one morning brief. It shows you what's behind, what's at risk, and what needs your attention today. It prepares the next step for you to approve. Nothing goes out without you.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="https://links.zenprocess.ai/widget/booking/rcoKJifJJA46bRI9fTEr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Book a demo</a>
          <a href="/owneros_demo" class="btn btn-ghost">See the live demo</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Built by Vinh Truong, CISSP. 20+ years leading enterprise IT and automation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="brief">
        <div class="bar"><b>OwnerOS</b><span style="opacity:.8">Good morning, Vinh</span><span class="r">Tuesday, July 14</span></div>
        <div class="body">
          <p class="lbl-s">Today's priorities</p>
          <div class="prio"><span class="d" style="background:#dc3545"></span><div><div class="t">3 invoices never went out</div><div class="s">$8,400 unbilled across 2 clients</div></div><span class="tag" style="background:var(--green-tint);color:var(--green-d)">Draft ready</span></div>
          <div class="prio"><span class="d" style="background:#f59e0b"></span><div><div class="t">Lead going cold: Riverside CPA</div><div class="s">No reply in 9 days</div></div><span class="tag" style="background:var(--green-tint);color:var(--green-d)">Follow-up drafted</span></div>
          <div class="prio"><span class="d" style="background:var(--green)"></span><div><div class="t">Month-end close on track</div><div class="s">11 of 14 clients reconciled</div></div></div>
          <div class="health">
            <div class="h"><div class="lbl-s">Cash</div><div class="n">$42k</div></div>
            <div class="h" style="background:var(--green-tint);border-color:var(--green-tint-2)"><div class="lbl-s">Overdue</div><div class="n" style="color:var(--green-d)">$11k</div></div>
            <div class="h"><div class="lbl-s">Unbilled</div><div class="n">$6k</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="approve"><span class="a" style="background:var(--green);color:#fff">Approve all</span><span class="a" style="border:1px solid var(--line-2);color:var(--ink-2)">Review</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROBLEM -->
  <section class="section-problem reveal text-center">
    <div class="wrap problem-wrap">
      <span class="kicker">Running it all yourself</span>
      <h2 class="problem-title">Running the business shouldn't be your second job.</h2>
      <p class="problem-desc">You already have software.<br><br>What you don't have is one place that tells you what needs your attention today.<br><br>That's what OwnerOS does.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="section-how reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>
      <div class="hiw-grid">
        <div class="card hiw-card"><div class="mono hiw-num">01</div><h3 class="hiw-title">Connect your tools</h3><p class="hiw-desc">Connect the tools you already use.<br>Nothing changes.<br>Nothing gets replaced.</p></div>
        <div class="card hiw-card"><div class="mono hiw-num">02</div><h3 class="hiw-title">Reviews your business overnight</h3><p class="hiw-desc">Every night OwnerOS reviews your business and finds what needs your attention before your day begins.</p></div>
        <div class="card hiw-card hiw-card-featured"><div class="mono hiw-num">03</div><h3 class="hiw-title">Your morning brief</h3><p class="hiw-desc">Start your day with one clear list.<br>Review the drafts.<br>Approve what should go out.<br>Move on with your day.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURE 1 -->
  <section class="section-feature reveal">
    <div class="wrap frow">
      <div class="txt">
        <span class="kicker">Every morning</span>
        <h2 class="feature-title">One morning brief.<br>Everything that needs your attention.</h2>
        <p class="feature-desc">Before you open your inbox, you'll know what's behind, what's at risk, and what needs your attention.<br><br>One place.<br>One list.<br>A better way to start your day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fvis">
        <p class="lbl-s">Today's priorities</p>
        <div class="checkline"><span class="c" style="background:rgba(220,53,69,.12);color:#dc3545">!</span><div><b>3 invoices never went out</b><div class="eyebrow">$8,400 unbilled · draft ready</div></div></div>
        <div class="checkline"><span class="c" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.14);color:#b45309">~</span><div><b>Lead going cold: Riverside CPA</b><div class="eyebrow">no reply in 9 days · follow-up drafted</div></div></div>
        <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><div><b>Month-end close on track</b><div class="eyebrow">11 of 14 clients reconciled</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURE 2 (reversed) -->
  <section class="section-feature reveal">
    <div class="wrap frow rev">
      <div class="txt">
        <span class="kicker">Ready to send</span>
        <h2 class="feature-title">It drafts the next action.</h2>
        <p class="feature-desc">Whether it's a follow-up, reminder, customer update, or meeting note, OwnerOS prepares the draft for you.<br><br>You review it.<br>You approve it.<br>You stay in control.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fvis draft-vis">
        <div class="draft-card">
          <div class="draft-header">To: Riverside CPA · Re: Q3 proposal</div>
          <div class="draft-body">Hi Dana, circling back on the Q3 proposal from last week. Happy to walk through it this Thursday or Friday if that is easier. Want me to hold a time?</div>
          <div class="draft-footer"><span class="a draft-approve">Approve & send</span><span class="a draft-edit">Edit</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT'S INCLUDED -->
  <section class="section-included reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">What's included</h2>
      <div class="incl-grid">
        <div><h3 class="incl-heading">The intelligence</h3>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Daily owner brief</span></div>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Stalled lead & unbilled work alerts</span></div>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Drafted follow-ups, ready for your approval</span></div>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Goal tracking against what matters this quarter</span></div>
        </div>
        <div><h3 class="incl-heading">CRM included</h3>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Capture leads and manage pipelines</span></div>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Book appointments online</span></div>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Nurture prospects and plan social content</span></div>
          <div class="checkline"><span class="c">✓</span><span>Unlimited contacts and users</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST -->
  <section class="section-trust reveal text-center">
    <div class="wrap trust-wrap">
      <span class="kicker">What you can count on</span>
      <h2 class="trust-title">Built to be trusted with your business</h2>
      <div class="stats trust-stats">
        <div><div class="n trust-n">CISSP</div><div class="eyebrow">security-first by design</div></div>
        <div><div class="n trust-n">Human</div><div class="eyebrow">approval before anything sends</div></div>
        <div><div class="n trust-n">Your tools</div><div class="eyebrow">nothing gets replaced</div></div>
        <div><div class="n trust-n">Day 1</div><div class="eyebrow">useful from your first brief</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECURITY -->
  <section class="section-security reveal">
    <div class="wrap card security-card text-center">
      <h2 class="security-title">Security first, by default</h2>
      <p class="security-desc">OwnerOS never sends on its own. A human approves before anything leaves your business. Your data stays yours, and access is scoped to what the work needs. Built by a CISSP who has run security for enterprise systems.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section-faq reveal faq">
    <div class="wrap faq-wrap">
      <h2 class="faq-title">Questions</h2>
      <details open><summary>Is my data secure?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>Yes. Access is scoped to what the work needs, nothing sends without your approval, and it is built by a CISSP. We do not train on your data.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does it replace the tools I use?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>No. OwnerOS reads across your existing CRM, books, inbox, and calendar. It sits on top; nothing is ripped out.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What does it cost?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>Pricing depends on your team size and the tools you connect. Book a demo and we'll walk through it.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I get started?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>Book a demo. We look at how you run today, connect your tools, and set up your first daily brief with you.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONVERSION CLOSE -->
  <section class="section-final-cta reveal text-center">
    <div class="wrap final-cta-wrap">
      <h2 class="final-cta-title">See your whole business in one place.</h2>
      <p class="final-cta-desc">If you run an owner-led firm, let's talk. A 30-minute demo, no pitch deck.</p>
      <a href="https://links.zenprocess.ai/widget/booking/rcoKJifJJA46bRI9fTEr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Book a demo</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    background: var(--hero-glow);
    padding-top: 84px;
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 20px 0 18px;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .section-problem {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .problem-wrap {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .problem-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 16px 0 14px;
  }
  .problem-desc {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .section-how {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
  }
  .hiw-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .hiw-card {
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .hiw-card-featured {
    border-color: var(--green-tint-2);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--green-tint), transparent 40%), var(--card);
  }
  .hiw-num {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green-d);
  }
  .hiw-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 14px 0 8px;
  }
  .hiw-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .section-feature {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .feature-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 38px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 14px 0 14px;
  }
  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .draft-vis {
    gap: 0;
  }
  .draft-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .draft-header {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .draft-body {
    padding: 16px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  .draft-footer {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .draft-approve {
    background: var(--green);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 9px;
  }
  .draft-edit {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 9px;
  }
  .section-included {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--canvas-2);
  }
  .incl-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 44px;
  }
  .incl-heading {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .section-trust {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .trust-wrap {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .trust-title {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 14px 0 30px;
  }
  .trust-stats {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .trust-n {
    color: var(--green-d);
  }
  .section-security {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .security-card {
    padding: 44px;
    max-width: 820px;
    background: var(--canvas-2);
  }
  .security-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .security-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 18px;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .section-faq {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .faq-wrap {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .faq-title {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-final-cta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--hero-glow);
  }
  .final-cta-wrap {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .final-cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .final-cta-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .btn-large {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 16px 28px;
  }
  @media(max-width:860px) {
    .hero-grid, .frow, .incl-grid, .hiw-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .frow.rev .txt {
      order: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
